.TH dokument\-thumbnailer 1 2025\-04\-22 GNOME
.SH NAME
dokument\-thumbnailer \- create png thumbnails from PDF, DjVu, TIFF documents
and Comic Books archives (CBR, CBT, CBZ, CB7)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdokument\-thumbnailer\fR [\-s \fBsize\fR] \fBinput\fR \fBoutput\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
dokument\-thumbnailer is a GNOME program to
create thumbnails from PDF, DjVu, TIFF documents and Comic Books archives
(CBR, CBT, CBZ, CB7).
.SH OPTIONS
dokument obeys all normal GNOME and GTK+
command line options. The only option \-s \fIsize
\fRmakes it possible to choose the vertical size
of the created thumbnail.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBdokument\fR(1)
